  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="256682ac-8ac3-5443-ae2f-59291afc1f12" activityNameId="77a7407d-0a10-55cb-896a-8c01ef1fad41" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Packaging glass, green, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Packaging glass, green, at plant
A production site with a sorting capacity of 100 kt per year and a total life span of 50 a is assumed.;
UUID: 2c00896f-3b3b-3dc9-bb39-adbcf32ac010
This module includes the material and energy efforts for: preparation and sorting of cullets, melting, forming of glass containers, cooling down, packaging and palletting until glass containers are ready for transport to customer. Transports for the input materials are included as well as direct emissions to air, waste water and waste.
Location: average European situation, based on information from EU-IPPC BAT document about the glass industry
Technology: Mix of present used technologies in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total production in 2000: 29 Mio t
Sampling: Average values from the ranges indicated in EC IPPC-BAT document are used 
Extrapolations: Input material mix is approximated by the respective material mix for Germany and Switzerland.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2c00896f-3b3b-3dc9-bb39-adbcf32ac010.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
